  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "provider 决定子任务怎么跑",
      "items": [
        "dsh 交付 spawn-in-process / fork / acp / codex / claude-code / dsh-sdk",
        "本例写一个离线可跑的 local-reviewer",
        "SubagentProvider 是 interface，不是可继承的类"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "start() 返回句柄，不是结果",
      "items": [
        "句柄含 id / localAgent / result promise / dispose()",
        "正因为句柄先兑现，建立与结束才是两个事件",
        "stopReason 词表：completed / aborted / error / max-tokens / refusal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "委派本身可以是模型可见能力",
      "items": [
        "dsh-tool-subagent 把已配置 provider 包成工具",
        "子代理结论作为规范工具结果返回",
        "生命周期用 06 那套纯监听方式观测"
      ]
    }
